Write and execute Python code to implement elastic net penalized quantile regression from scratch using proximal gradient descent. The code should:

1. Load data from /mnt/data/lengyang/youjia_project/autoba/BABench/src/promptbio-bench/tasks/b-8-10/result_79/toolsgenie_20260709/data/microbiome_il6_data.csv
